      "description": {
        "en": "Upgrades fenced code blocks in the conversation into rich components: inline SVG/HTML, Mermaid diagrams, KaTeX math, artifact cards, collapsible reasoning blocks, code copy and theme polish. Mermaid and KaTeX are bundled offline; no external requests.",
